    function testFuzz_property(address proposedNewOwner) public {
        // Keep the domain wide but avoid the zero address for the interim step where we will transfer to an actor
        // (we still allow proposedNewOwner==address(0) because the reference disallows transfer to zero by require,
        // so such inputs will revert; that's allowed.)

        // We are going to assert a universal property: when the current owner calls transferOwnership(newOwner),
        // afterward owner() == newOwner (or the call reverts). The reference always sets owner to newOwner; the mutant
        // sometimes breaks this.

